WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.900
Hi, friends!

2
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.420
Let's go back in time!

3
00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.180
Long, long ago, there were dinosaurs.

4
00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:12.800
Listen!

5
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.380
Stomp, stomp!

6
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:17.940
Look!

7
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.100
A giant dinosaur is coming!

8
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.360
It is a T. rex!

9
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.780
Its long name is Tyrannosaurus rex.

10
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.220
It lives in North America.

11
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.860
T. rex is very big.

12
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.120
It is as long as a bus!

13
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.100
It is very tall, too.

14
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.660
Look how small the people are!

15
00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.700
And it is as heavy as five cars!

16
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.980
Now it is walking.

17
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.920
It is walking on two big legs.

18
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.040
Look at its big feet!

19
00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.680
Each foot has three big toes.

20
00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.700
Scientists think a T. rex made this footprint.

21
00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.780
Now it is opening its mouth.

22
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.500
Look at its teeth!

23
00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:07.660
Its biggest teeth are longer than a banana!

24
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.000
They are very sharp!

25
00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:12.460
Chomp!

26
00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.340
It has a super strong bite.

27
00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:17.880
It can even crunch bones!

28
00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.300
Now look at its arms.

29
00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:23.700
Its arms are so tiny!

30
00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.640
Each hand has just two fingers.

31
00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.100
But it has a big nose.

32
00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.220
It can smell food from far away!

33
00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.260
Sniff, sniff!

34
00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.320
Now it is hunting.

35
00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:39.620
Look!

36
00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:42.960
It is grabbing a Triceratops!

37
00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.120
Today, we can see its bones.

38
00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.660
This is Sue, a famous T. rex.

39
00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.720
Sue is in a big museum in Chicago.

40
00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.340
Let's say the words!

41
00:01:58.180 --> 00:01:59.740
T. rex!

42
00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:03.360
Dinosaur!

43
00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:06.540
Big!

44
00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:09.880
Tall!

45
00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.180
Heavy!

46
00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.540
Walk!

47
00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:19.680
Teeth!

48
00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:22.920
Sharp!

49
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.200
Bite!

50
00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.540
Arms!

51
00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:32.980
Nose!

52
00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.420
Bones!

53
00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:39.880
Museum!

54
00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.410
Great job!

55
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.050
Bye-bye, T. rex!

56
00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:48.330
Oh!

57
00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:51.050
It is opening its mouth!

58
00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.910
It is only yawning!

59
00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:54.950
See you next time!
